WEBVTT

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.170
Squid Girlie!

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.900
Why don't you wait for them
to get to the door?

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.390
This way!

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:46.040
Huh?

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.000
Doorbell ditch?

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:52.100
You ring someone's doorbell
and run away.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.500
Isn't that a squiddle unpleasant for them?

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.680
What the heck?
Aren't you supposed to be an invader?

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:58.680
Lame, let's go.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.310
Okay, see you Squid Girlie.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.600
<b>Wanna doorbell ditch, squiddo?</b>

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:18.370
All right, I'll show them my
squid-invader spirit!

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:20.390
Oh?

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.490
Squid Girl, do you need
something from them?

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.130
I-I-I-It's nothing!

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:26.700
I needed to call on them,
but it looks like they're not home!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.370
I'm off then!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.490
Who is it?

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:29.560
Oh, Chizuru.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:30.490
Hello!

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:31.330
She knows them?!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.650
Thank you again for last week.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:36.660
Don't mention it.
I bet the business is a lot of work.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.660
I have to get away before
Chizuru notices...

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:37.780
Well, I suppose.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:40.120
Squid Girl, I thought you
needed something.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.330
Oh, from us?

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.710
They must think that
I'm suspicious!

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.850
Oh, are you a friend of Kiyomi's?

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:49.790
That's it!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.880
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.520
Kiyomi won't be home
until this evening

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.590
because of her club at school.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:58.070
Oh, how unfortunate!
Well, I'll be back then!

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:58.810
I'm home.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.820
Oh Kiyomi, you're home early.
Your friend came by.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.110
Ink me...

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.980
Uh, who are you?

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.360
You must be exhausted from your club!

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:09.830
I was waiting for you!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:10.750
Uh, who...

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.670
Anyway, let's go to the park!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.210
Wait, let me at least drop my bag.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.710
She's a little strange, huh?

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.170
Well, she's a squid.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.010
Huh? Doorbell ditch?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.010
It was a strange squidly impulse!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.870
I didn't mean to cause
any trouble...

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:28.370
Why would you do something
so childish?

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.600
I'll be in trouble if
Chizuru finds out.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.310
Can't you just pretend
that we're friends?

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.600
What if I say "no" to that?

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:35.540
Oh no...

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.750
Squid it...

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.490
I'm game if we don't pretend.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.700
I'm okay if we don't just
pretend to be friends.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:46.700
Does that...

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.910
I'd like to get to know you better.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:53.490
So you'll be my friend?

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:54.120
Yes.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.550
I mean, you're interesting.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:59.050
Just the way you look
is kind of suspicious.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.340
And your hat is quite unusual, too.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:03.350
Oh by the way, what's your name?

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.650
Squid Girl.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.620
That's a weird nickname.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.790
That's my real name.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:10.950
And you're... Kiyomi, right?

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.010
Yes, Sakura Kiyomi.

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.330
Nice to meet you, Squid Girl.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.320
Nice to meet you, too.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:39.130
Oh wow, it's already this late.
I've got to go.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.680
But I haven't finished my story yet.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.670
Just tell me the rest next time.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.470
Then, you wanna come over
to my place tomorrow?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.810
Are you sure you don't
have to ask first?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:54.010
Of course I can invite
a friend over.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.270
Then let's meet here
tomorrow at three.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.610
Tentastic.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.120
Bye bye, Squiddie!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.100
Bye bye.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:07.530
Oh crap. I got carried away and
spoke without thinking.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.340
If Chizuru found out...

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.080
Who do you think you are?!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.520
Maybe I shouldn't take
her home, but...

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:19.220
No, a squid doesn't go
back on her word!

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:22.530
I don't squidding care about Chizuru!

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.470
I'm running late.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:26.990
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.310
I just got here, too.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.890
Squiddie's quite popular...

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.010
This is my house.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.480
It's nice.

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:42.300
I'll deal with the consequences later!

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:43.800
I'm home.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.190
Wel-

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.590
This is my friend, Kiyomi.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.530
Hello.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.540
Friend?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.830
Can we play some video games?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.880
Uh, sure.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.020
Thanks for having me over.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.210
S-Sure.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:01.670
This is the first time you
brought home a friend.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.250
She's inktimidating.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:06.620
Th-This way!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.050
Let's duke it out with SF4.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.730
So Squid Girl finally made a friend, eh?

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.780
Oh, I'm pretty good at that.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:16.560
We'll have to do everything in
our power to support her!

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:26.270
Here you go.

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:27.670
Thank you very much.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.470
You're welcome. Squid Girl...

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:32.820
Good luck!

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.230
What's with the squidding
scary face?!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.490
Kiyomi, thank you for becoming
friends with Squid Girl.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:40.500
No, it's a pleasure.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.210
Make yourself at home.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.460
Your sister is really pretty.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.730
That face... that was the
face of wrath inkarnate.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:52.500
You do understand what
consequences there are

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.750
for randomly inviting people over
without permission, right?

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:58.890
I knew I shouldn't have invited
someone over without permission.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.750
Squiddie!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.480
What's wrong?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.190
Nothing.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:03.690
Are you sure?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.410
Let's play another round!

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:05.900
Okay.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:07.230
So how's it going?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.040
She's a really nice girl.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.610
And I instilled some spirit
into Squid Girl, too.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.700
I guess I'll help out, too.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.080
I'll get my revenge!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.710
You'll have to train harder
if you want to beat me.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.170
Heya.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.660
Having fun?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.390
Oh, Eiko, it's you.

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.320
Here you go.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.390
Oooh, it's Hedgehog Kart!

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.240
You've been wanting to play it.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:32.260
Because today's special.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.800
Special? What does that mean?!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.350
Squid Girl, I'm glad
you made a friend.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.350
That was the face of pity!

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:41.520
Have fun.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.730
Your second sister's cool, too.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:49.230
Eiko has never been
that nice before.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:52.190
You'll be killed by Chizuru soon.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:55.060
Might as well let you play
all the games you want.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.330
So that's why?!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.430
Squiddie!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.050
Are you okay?

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.620
You've been acting weird,
and you're all pale.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.650
I'm okay.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.450
Squid Girlie.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:07.960
That was outside.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.670
The weather's beautiful!
Let's play together!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:14.110
This is your last chance to run.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.460
Don't you want to live?

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.850
I can't run and leave Kiyomi here.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.300
I brought you some more tea.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.560
Could it be... poisoned?!

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.130
This is the punishment

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.550
for bringing someone over
without my permission.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.150
Atone with your death!

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.230
I don't wanna die!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.090
Holy crap, are you okay?!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:41.020
I don't wanna die, I don't wanna die,
I don't wanna die!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.080
Squiddie, are you okay?

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.160
Kiyomi!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:50.710
I'm really glad that
I got to meet you.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:51.670
Squiddie?

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.740
We'll be friends,
no matter what happens!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.680
Of course we will.
What are you talking about?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.220
I can't let you get dragged into this,
so you should go home now.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.330
I don't really get it,
but I'll go home.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.020
Wha-?

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.980
Thanks for having me over.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:10.770
So...

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.440
So?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:15.500
Sorry for inviting my friend
over without permission!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.110
Say what?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.660
You can boil me, grill me,
or do whatever you want!

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.450
Just calm down, Squid Girl.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:24.680
Kiyomi, our hearts will be connected,
even in death.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.420
Squiddie's so weird.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:33.740
Hey, what the squid is this?

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.630
Oh, I never get to use it,
so you can have it.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.800
Hmm...

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.530
I can write with it!

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.930
You're wasting it.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.930
You're supposed to apply
it to your lips.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.010
Here's a mirror.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.970
I don't know where the lips end.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.910
That still doesn't explain
what you did.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.910
<b>Can squids put on makeup?</b>

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:08.620
How about that?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.340
Wow, I'm a different squid!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.760
It looks pretty good on you.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.840
Not bad.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:21.300
I like it. I'll keep it
this way for today.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.310
You should watch out for
a certain person...

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.620
Squiddie's wearing lipstick!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.000
That was quick.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.780
Squiddie... lipstick...

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:32.240
Kiss...

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.140
Lipstick...

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:33.750
Kiss...

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:34.320
Kiss!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.540
Squiddie, kiss!

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.120
Eek, she's coming for me.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:42.660
Squiddie! Kiss!

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:39.960
She's fast!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.490
You can have it!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.540
That's Squiddie's... lipstick!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.180
Wait!

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:51.460
She would go that far?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.950
That's almost worthy of respect.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:55.340
Sanae's quite good at butterfly.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.630
Lipstick!

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:01.860
What's up?

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.660
What are those people?

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.210
Did they get caught in a fire?

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:07.720
That's Yamanba makeup.

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:09.780
That looks old-fashioned.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:11.490
It is quite an old trend.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:13.540
So is that visual-kei?

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.170
No, they're just cross-dressing.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.640
Visual-kei is, that...

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.520
Aren't they warm?

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:19.280
I don't care.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.970
Are those living dolls?

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.110
Those are geisha apprentices.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.020
I've seen that style a lot lately.

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.590
Yeah, that's in right now.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.790
Hey...

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.350
How the squid do you
do that makeup?

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.790
Check her out.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.140
She's like, hilarious!

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:36.470
So I guess she's taken an
interest in makeup.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:39.020
I suppose, in the end,
she's also just a girl.

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:49.890
I finally got it... Squiddie's lipstick...

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:59.780
Squiddie, you liar!
But I still love you!

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:01.600
Thanks.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.620
Thank you!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.520
Eiko, I got them to
do my makeup!

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:07.580
Whoa, too thick!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.120
We've got to get that off!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.700
What are you doing?
I just got that done!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.210
You need to keep the bigger
picture in mind!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.930
Then what kind of squidly
makeup style is good?

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:22.930
I... uhh, Nagisa, what
would you do?

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.880
I don't wear makeup, so...

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:29.140
Squid Girl, you're still young,
so you're cuter without makeup.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.470
But they said...

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:33.500
With this makeup, men fall
to their knees right away.

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.440
Like, totally!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.130
You see!

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:39.060
I need to subdue mankind and make
them fall to their knees, too!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:41.230
They're talking about
something else!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.710
I definitely need makeup.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:46.060
I'll have to do whatever it takes.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.450
Well, I guess she'll snap
out of it soon.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.820
What kind of makeup do I need?

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:58.680
Hey, Squid. One shrimp fried rice.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:02.950
I'm busy. Place your order
inside with Eiko.

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:05.430
All right, I'll go place
it with Chizuru.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.470
Hey, why are you getting
in my way?

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:17.400
Do you know what kind of makeup would
be suitable for a squid like me?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.120
I see.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:22.820
Well it's true that you might need
makeup suited for an invader

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.580
if you want to be perceived
as such.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.290
So I do need makeup to
make them kneel...

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.970
You couldn't intimidate
anyone without it.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.740
How dare you.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:37.060
I will show you terrifying make
up worthy of a squid-invader.

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.500
Just you wait!

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:41.520
Done. What do you think?

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.770
Wow. That's quite a change.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:45.930
What about you, Eiko?

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:48.110
Naw, I'm not into that.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.260
Don't be shy now.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.770
Please, give it a shot.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:51.640
You think I should?

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.260
All right, have a seat.

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:57.720
See, it looks good.

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:00.780
I... it almost feels like it's not me.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.150
It's done!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.650
This is my masterpiece!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.640
Behold and cower!

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.350
It's not quite scary...

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.240
Just creepy.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.540
What do you think?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.130
I guess it's harder to
approach you now.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.300
It might be good for warding
off evil spirits.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:18.400
I can't make you kneel
if you're not afraid!

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.730
Look, what do you think?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:24.550
Oh my!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.030
Is that Takeru?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:26.760
Cute...

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.590
Everyone's fallen...

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.760
No way! I'll use his style, too!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.280
Nothing came off.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.730
What did you use?

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.400
Ah, permanent markers.
That wouldn't come off.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.440
It's not squidding coming off!

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:54.990
It's hot.

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:58.350
With so many hot days in a row,

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:01.210
I might just believe that
our planet's done for.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.050
It's all the fault of the humans

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:05.660
who keep destroying
Mother Nature.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.840
She's patiently waiting
for the right time

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.420
to launch a full on invasion.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:12.510
But if you're always cooped
up in the lab,

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.470
this heat does feel quite nice.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.100
When did you get here?

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.870
Could I have an iced coffee?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:18.890
Sure thing.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.900
<b>Holy squid!
Is that a secret weapon?</b>

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.360
You really do have a lot
of time on your hands.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.400
Don't you have work to do?

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.240
This is my work.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.730
I'm not going to the squidly lab.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.660
Watch out, Squiddie!

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.950
Where are you trying to
take my Squiddie?!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.550
How does she always
get here so fast?

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.370
Well, Squiddie's so cute

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.380
that I do understand why you
want to take her home.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.340
But forcing her to go
with you is a crime!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:49.560
Too bad for you, but I've already
taken her before.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.060
What? When?!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:54.280
She made a promise to come to the
lab if I became her squid-underling.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:55.400
Underling?

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:57.430
I would be your squidling
for nothing!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.900
Why her? Why, Squiddie?!

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.430
A promise is a promise...

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.560
I am purely interested
in studying her...

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.810
as an alien.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.230
Alien?

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:12.630
How dare you lump together Squiddie
in with those gross things?!

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:16.010
You're calling aliens gross?

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.600
I guess you want to really
piss me off then.

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.820
What? You wanna go?

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.690
In any case, you can't
have Squiddie!

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.410
I'm not anybody's squid!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:26.170
All right, break it up.
We've got tons of work.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:26.890
Hey!

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:28.760
Eiko, that's not fair.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.170
Who decided that you get
a monopoly on Squiddie?!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:33.930
What you two want from
her is just whacked.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.970
I'm only using her as an errand girl.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.450
I am an invader!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.850
No, you're an alien!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.680
Now let's go to my lab!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.670
Work comes first.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.340
No!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.800
You two are too flirty!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:49.940
Flirty? What?

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.370
I know all about it!

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:55.490
Lately you've been studying together,
playing games together,

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.320
and even sleeping together!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.200
Wrong, what you're imagining
is just wrong.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.950
Hah, that's nothing more
than communication.

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.930
Not only did I have to
experience her tentacles,

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:07.320
I've also been covered in this mysterious,
sticky substance...

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.700
Stop using double entendres!

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:10.550
That's not fair...

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:16.260
I also love Squiddie, but I've never
had any of that done to me!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.220
Seriously...

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.870
At least do those things
to me, too!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.420
But I want it harder!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:25.860
If it'll make you feel better, do it.

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:27.010
Are you retarded?

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.520
Squid Girl, outside please.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.030
Wonderful!

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:37.500
So much... Squiddie...

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.620
So... happy!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.750
Ew!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.730
Good for you. It looks like
you got what you wanted.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:47.750
Speaking of intense communication
with Squid Girl...

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:49.880
Nobody can top my sister,

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.750
since she had a fight to
the death with her.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.650
She did?

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:56.130
I can't really picture
her like that...

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.180
I was traumatized.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.540
I can't believe the squid
person is so scared.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.010
I want to have a fight.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:07.040
I want to cross the line of having
fought an alien to the death!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:07.860
Me too!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.100
She got back up!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.490
Squiddie!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:11.980
Prepare yourself!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.230
No squidding way!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.050
Nice fight.

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:20.490
Good morning, everybody.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:21.980
You guys!

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:24.640
Long time no see, Squid Girl.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.910
Natural light is so harsh.

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:30.830
Huh? Cindy isn't here?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.090
She should have gotten
here already.

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:43.780
Eiko, you know these people?

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:45.030
Who are they?

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:47.430
Oh yeah, you don't know them.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.940
They're researchers
from Cindy's lab.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:53.320
I graduated top of my class from
MIT. My name is Harris.

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:56.020
I graduated top of my class from
MIT. My name is Clark.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.110
I graduated top of...

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.110
We get it!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:59.600
These are my squid-underlings, too.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:00.950
These three stooges, too?!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.100
Please don't underestimate them.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:04.620
We're the pride of America...

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.990
In that get-up you're just
a suspicious group.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.710
Why don't you take off those
stuffy white coats

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.390
when you come to the
beach, at least?

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.910
You look like perverts.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:17.050
We can't do that because!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:21.090
They're full of tools we
want to demonstrate.

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:21.800
So you are a pervert!

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:24.580
Those things all look dangerous.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.890
You could even get
arrested for that.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.430
It's not a problem.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:31.780
We left the things that can explode
or rupture at the lab.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:32.460
Explode?!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.100
Rupture?!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.490
What we brought today is:

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:40.740
a bullet that speeds growth, a bullet
that makes you invisible...

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:41.590
How much?!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:42.450
Stop your nose bleed!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.990
And a bullet that grants you
the dignity of an invader.

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.120
Would you like to test it?

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.400
Can I?!

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:50.910
I'll set it up then.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.050
Hey...

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.240
It's not like I believe it!

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:57.440
I just thought that I could
assist them a squiddle bit!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.290
It's obvious they're lying.

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:03.800
You can see for yourself
if we're lying or not.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.430
W-Wait, I haven't prepared
myself yet!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.600
I'm going to fire.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.230
Stop! I'll do it myself!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.900
H-Hey...

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.320
Explode, rupture...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.200
Explode, rupture...

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.400
Explode, rupture...

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:24.280
Can I fire a test shot first?

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.280
Sure.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:38.840
Wonderful.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:41.310
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:43.990
Actually, my soul died
a little there!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:44.800
I can't breathe...

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.070
I have a newfound respect
for you Cindy!

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:49.420
Your scientific know-how
is amazing!

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.510
Oh, thanks.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.050
But now we don't know

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:55.450
if this actually grants you
the dignity of an invader.

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.010
She's right.

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.560
You should show us what
it's like on yourselves.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.400
You're not going to say that
you can't do it, right?

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.260
Of course not. Martin, please.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:08.290
Step up there.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:09.620
Why is it always me?

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:15.500
Our inventions are infallible!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.290
That's too scary!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:25.550
The store...

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:26.750
Disappeared.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:31.360
You are god-man.
We are god-men!

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.910
That was a great success!

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:35.390
What was?

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:37.020
I have no clue.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:37.620
Me neither.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:39.480
You should, you're the
leader of those fools.

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:45.410
What did you do to my store?!

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:46.520
Guard!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.370
So, what are you going to do now?

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:54.670
We're sorry!

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:55.640
We'll take responsibility!

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:57.000
We'll rebuild it right away!

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:59.250
I see you got the point.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.140
No squidding surprise there.

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:02.880
Good to see it resolved
without any deaths.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:05.930
Maybe the real menace
looming over humanity

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:07.930
is not the squid person but...

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:44.670
We're the Idiots Three!

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:46.690
Isn't that a Teru Teru bosquid?

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:47.950
What squidsn't there to like?

00:23:47.950 --> 00:23:49.400
One! Two! Three squids and you're out!

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.610
Maybe so good animation!

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:53.680
All free! See you!
